Documentation
-------------

The manual is in doc/foxtrot.texi (info foxtrot).  The reference is the man
pages: foxtrot(7) is the overview, and foxtrot_NAME(3) is the page for each
header (man gf_key_from_blob finds the one with that function, once the
system's man database has them).  examples/ has complete programs to read and
copy: ssh-run (run a command), sftp-get (fetch a file), ssh-serve (a small
server), keyinfo, krl-check and cert-sign, with example.h for the part of an
application that the library leaves out.  They are installed as source in the
documentation directory, and run by make check.
